# Clan Aundae: "The Vampire Hunter" (VA_VampHunter). Dhaunayne Aundae sends the player after a hunter ("vampire
# hunter": 10, enables Ano Vando; "I will kill this vampire hunter for all to see." 1: 20). Anarenen in Ald'ruhn's
# Mages Guild names him (50; the line is NotLocal NoLore == 0, so Edwinna Elbert, whose script declares NoLore,
# keeps quiet). Killed in daylight in Ald'ruhn (anoScript: 9:00-17:00 -> 70), Dhaunayne
# rewards the player with her amulet (90); "future rewards" closes it (100).
# The wait stands in for a player waiting for day; the kill stands in for the fight.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from va_hunter_start --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case va_hunter_start
approach 05A7D05F
talk dhaunayne aundae
ask plan to serve me
ask vampire hunter
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampHunter == 10
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampHunter == 20
bye
approach 05CEBDE3
talk anarenen
ask vampire hunter
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampHunter == 50
bye
end

case va_hunter_kill
rest 24 - GameHour >= 10
approach 05905199
wait 60
bye if open
defend
console 05905199.kill
until 600 GetJournalIndex VA_VampHunter == 70
end

case va_hunter_reward
approach 05A7D05F
talk dhaunayne aundae
ask vampire hunter
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampHunter == 90
expect player->GetItemCount "amulet_aundae" == 1
ask future rewards
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampHunter == 100
bye
end
